1
00:00:00,842 --> 00:00:02,172
(Amy:)Howard?

2
00:00:05,012 --> 00:00:07,642
- Ready for bed?
- No. I need to brush my teeth...

3
00:00:07,807 --> 00:00:10,557
(Bernadette:)...but your mother's been
in the bathroom for an hour.

4
00:00:10,726 --> 00:00:13,436
(Howard:)Oh, yeah, she sometimes
has problems doing her business.

5
00:00:13,604 --> 00:00:14,984
Hang on, ahem.

6
00:00:15,147 --> 00:00:16,437
(Howard:)Ma, give up!

7
00:00:16,607 --> 00:00:19,237
(Howard:)Tonight's not your night!

8
00:00:19,861 --> 00:00:22,651
You don't know that, I just sat down!

9
00:00:23,114 --> 00:00:24,444
(Howard:)Come on, take a break.

10
00:00:24,615 --> 00:00:26,705
(Howard:)Bernadette needs to brush her teeth.

11
00:00:26,868 --> 00:00:32,028
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)She can come in
and brush her teeth. I'm not embarrassed.

